  "title": "French Pastry Pie Crust",
  "description": "This recipe makes a sweet dough that is perfect for fruit pies or tarts. A bit of sugar, an egg and vinegar make this dough different from the traditional, but the end result is pastry that is manageable and flaky. Try adding a bit of lemon zest if you &#39;re feeling adventurous.",
